比不上专业剪辑师，但是现在Claude code和Codex的剪辑能力，尤其是有了GPT-6 astra之后，确实已经比我自己强出一大截了。
尤其是根据字幕节点找素材，配素材的能力，如果是我自己干的，我可能会烦死。
@aigc1024

The intense concern about an AI-driven apocalypse is itself a kind of media story. The concern developed on insular message boards like LessWrong (you can read today about all the ways AI could kill us) and is now the subject of discussion primarily on a platform designed to promote extreme views, X. The other surface is AI company Slack servers, which can, at their worst, become a kind of internal X, only with more groupthink.
Semafor’s Reed Albergotti made the case Saturday that the topic of AI safety “escaped containment in the laboratory that is San Francisco, spread by a breathless media for whom mass extinction is — let’s face it — an incredibly fun story. Now that it’s infected the networks of Washington and Brussels, the biggest risk may be that hysteria replaces thoughtful debate.”https://www.semafor.com/article/09/12/2026/how-the-ai-apocalypse-story-escaped-containment
